  "scope": [
    "Three selected pilot vehicles; no fleet learning or population inference.",
    "Reuse 9 broadband training records from the gate; known zero initial states, yaw-only nonlinear OE.",
    "All four CT ratios including mu are free in LocalCT2 and JointCT4. FixedCT4 frees only relaxation lengths.",
    "Three deterministic starts selected by training SSE only; save unsuccessful attempts.",
    "Two three-point conditional-on-one-length profiles per joint fit; nuisance parameters reoptimized from selected training fit. Profiles are local optimizer diagnostics, not global profiles or confidence intervals.",
    "Independent phase/frequency validation probes at three observed and two unobserved speeds. No test-data selection or warmup fitting.",
    "All six control methods use model-matched yaw-only linear Kalman observers and identical beta/yaw/integral costs. No direct force-state penalty.",
    "Force process covariance is an untuned design allowance, not physical process noise.",
    "Known-parameter references have privileged parameters but no privileged online state measurements.",
    "Control tests are fixed-speed tapered sinusoidal yaw references; not standardized lane-change tests.",
    "All finite violations retained; failures have null full-duration metrics and prevent unconditional aggregate means."
  ]
